{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2017-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1506816000, "end_date": 1507420799, "month_true_total": 2314, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:56:31 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "35557678", "author": {"steamid": "76561198139891655", "personaname": "EatandChu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/eatandchu/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 26316, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 18792, "last_played": 1705767414, "avatar": "15f9b29d04857fe06e6063434815c70044dbe076"}, "language": "english", "review": "How do i play?", "timestamp_created": 1507418631, "timestamp_updated": 1507418631, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.480192065238952637", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "35556829", "author": {"steamid": "76561198054375693", "personaname": "Groggy Gamer", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/GroggyGamer/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 77056, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 43000, "last_played": 1728081069, "avatar": "2648b8bf2a176645c47b8002c0dc0be6e7f9af05"}, "language": "english", "review": "I started playing this game just to play with a friend that was moving away. We would get on and converse, keeping in touch through it. Eventually, I found a clan for us to join, and that's where things started to surprise me. I made new friends, all while playing a phenominal game. I eventually moved up through the ranks, and before I knew it I had been promoted to co-leader. Unfortunately, things didn't work out with the prior leader coming back and making threats... VERY long story. So, me and the other two leaders formed a new clan, with many former members of the other clan joining us. We formed an alliance with another clan, and already have decent standing in the community. This game has surprised me quite a bit. Great story, awesome gameplay, and a sense of progression I rarely feel with similar titles. Plus, a community that feels genuine and accepting, with every type of person coming together that makes the community as diverse as the world we live in. I have fun with this game, and it keeps me interested no matter how long I've been playing. There's always something to do, whether it be collecting materials for crafting, questing with friends or randos, or challenging yourself with the daily sortie. An engaging story, fast paced combat, collectible weapons and characters, and a community that is easilly one of the best ones I've ever been apart of. Welcome to the Origin System, Tenno.", "timestamp_created": 1507415632, "timestamp_updated": 1507415632, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "35556462", "author": {"steamid": "76561198370096376", "personaname": "maiko", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/_maiko/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 102284, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 87, "playtime_at_review": 19984, "last_played": 1789192006, "avatar": "4f05eabf7f40a32a42ecb6cfa5cadb8b681c4071"}, "language": "english", "review": "etz very gud gem, play plis", "timestamp_created": 1507414389, "timestamp_updated": 1507414389, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": 